      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**⬇️ 第三层：三大风险的**"
    },
    {
      "id": "92f858e43e9b4981",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -46479,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**⬇️ 第二层：两本账的“分水岭”**"
    },
    {
      "id": "92e1e054453c430a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -46479,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**。触发条件通常与发行银行资本充足水平挂钩，如一级资本比率跌破预定阈值**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c92ddf13fa8f4de0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -46479,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**。转换后债券本金按固定转换比率换算为普通股。其关键因素是**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae12db6a8f734842",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -46369,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**《多德–弗兰克法案》**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c647158ca192468f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -46369,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一、信用风险 vs. 信贷风险 vs. 交易对手风险 (19 · 1 · 1)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9bd69cf4281c4be8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -46369,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一、基本Black-Scholes欧式看涨期权定价公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc6c5421de7f4c6b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -46259,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一句话归纳**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6237c23aa3c4320",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -46259,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一句话记忆**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4fdba38459d74ffe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -46259,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一年**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3fbc99a30c843e7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -46149,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一致性（Coherence）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d9a17b29b25b42b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -46149,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一致性：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "7ccac060927c4438",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -46149,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一致风险度量**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9bc41e177241421e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -46039,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一般三元正态相关结构（协方差矩阵）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "df2b66517c6e4381",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -46039,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一行公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8a1683882004ed3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -46039,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**一行记忆**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9f25708473044d0d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45929,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三、CDS–债券价差方向 & 抽样表 (19 · 2 同页)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a9353842f0644bd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45929,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三、推广的Black-Scholes公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "46dd69770d4544cb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45929,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三种 VaR 测算方法及优缺点**"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9eb3e85359e415a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45819,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**上升**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1bf26ad60a1d4e15",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45819,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**上升而下降**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1c534f9f1da4fc3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45819,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**上尾相关**"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf196f3d4e0c4a12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45709,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**上课提问(大概率会考)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "49c846d672ff4242",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45709,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下降**"
    },
    {
      "id": "184df84a5c0b4025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45709,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下降约 $23.82\\%$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "9d2f972efc0f4bbf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45599,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下降约 $25.73\\%$**"
    },
    {
      "id": "1140677858d84723",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45599,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**下限期权（Floor）和利率期权债券**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d47925afe12b42e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45599,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不**"
    },
    {
      "id": "af7f1c14c601478e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45489,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不付股息股票欧式期权**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3f3b693e5f3e42a5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45489,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不保证满足次可加性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c48df545c5954ba1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45489,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不关心独立风险/极端风险**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d61c99f8012f4c78",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45379,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不关注VaR之外的损失（尾部风险）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "38ad2fa94a544f15",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45379,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不反映绝对风险或极端尾部**"
    },
    {
      "id": "40b2c2869e7f4e5d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45379,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不同VaR方法的对比分析（优劣、适用场景）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "b753b1ce2d984e01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45269,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不同衍生品在CVA中的表现与计算差异**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d7aa0977cce44636",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45269,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不含信用风险**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c63e09ea9ab2476f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45269,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不改变真实经济风险**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a111288a630c42df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45159,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不满足**"
    },
    {
      "id": "21916b71af5c474d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45159,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不直接使用**"
    },
    {
      "id": "583ec69cfb3e4a65",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45159,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不能反映分布尾部极端损失、不可加**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3f127c111ce4bbf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -45049,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不能捕捉尾部和偏度**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8bc64b78dfd847ed",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -45049,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**不鼓励全面对冲CVA**"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec69b96ffb444435",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -45049,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**与VaR的结合：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "576f9d0686104791",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -44939,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**两**"
    },
    {
      "id": "af6b1db301eb474f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -44939,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**两资产/多资产矩阵公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "cc1dcac327884499",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -44939,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**严格地对复杂衍生品组合进行全重估**"
    },
    {
      "id": "50cf62c008c5465e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -44829,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**严格监管**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f53e194497fd43ba",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -44829,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**中央对手方清算**"
    },
    {
      "id": "a464e20ec5324186",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -44829,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**中央对手方清算（CCP）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8f8b73022324d05",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -44719,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**中心清算（净额结算）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "8ca553ff082c4f38",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -44719,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**临界值/拒绝域计算：**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d57486568517473f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -44719,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**临界标的价格**"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a44087ea0fc4110",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -44609,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**主协议补充条款**"
    },
    {
      "id": "feb3b3482160432b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -44609,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**主成分分析法（PCA）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a496e3fee8046ae",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -44609,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**主成分分析（利率因子：平移/扭动/弯曲等）**"
    },
    {
      "id": "2535a5b96491446a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -44499,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**主要公式**"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a41dd3687c4d0c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -44499,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**主要衡量内容**"
    },
